  m_Name: Holy Pistol_GunData
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameEnglish: The Pious Pistol
  descriptionEnglish: '"The Pious Pistol" is a magnificent weapon that radiates with
    divine power. Cast in solid gold, it is adorned with intricate engravings of
    holy symbols and is said to have been blessed by the heavens themselves.'
  nameChinese: "\u795E\u5723\u624B\u67AA"
  descriptionChinese: "\u795E\u5723\u624B\u67AA\u662F\u4E00\u4EF6\u8F89\u714C\u7684\u6B66\u5668\uFF0C\u6563\u53D1\u7740\u795E\u5723\u7684\u529B\u91CF\u3002\u5B83\u662F\u7531\u5B9E\u5FC3\u91D1\u94F8\u9020\u800C\u6210\uFF0C\u9970\u6709\u590D\u6742\u7684\u5723\u7B26\u7EB9\u9970\uFF0C\u5E76\u636E\u8BF4\u662F\u7531\u5929\u5802\u672C\u8EAB\u795D\u798F\u8FC7\u7684\u3002"
  namePortuguese: A Pistola Piedosa
  descriptionPortuguese: "\"A Pistola Piedosa\" \xE9 uma arma magn\xEDfica que irradia
    um poder divino. Fundida em ouro maci\xE7o, \xE9 adornada com intricadas gravuras
    de s\xEDmbolos sagrados e diz-se que foi aben\xE7oada pelos c\xE9us."
  nameSpanish: La Pistola Piadosa
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "\u201CLa Pistola Piadosa\u201D es una magn\xEDfica arma
    que irradia poder divino. Fundida en oro s\xF3lido, est\xE1 adornada con intrincados
    grabados de s\xEDmbolos sagrados y se dice que ha sido bendecida por los cielos
    mismos."
